assets/terminal-notifier.app is a vendored copy of terminal-notifier (v2.0.0, arm64),
bundled unmodified so `jovida daemon` can post Jovida-branded desktop notifications
with zero install. Upstream: https://github.com/julienXX/terminal-notifier

